"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of untreated malignancy\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \", except for local skin cancers\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of treated malignancy within the past 5 years.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have had an ischemic stroke\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"AND\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"determined using the Questionnaire for Verifying Stroke-Free Status (QVSFS)\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or have had a transient ischemic attack (TIA).\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Are on renal dialysis or have end-stage hepatic dysfunction\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of liver transplant.\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Have an acute infection/inflammation\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"with a temperature > 101.5 F\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"and/or WBC > 15,000\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"and/or other signs of infection.\"\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"right\": {\n      \"OR\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"Are unable to obtain informed consent from patient or next of kin\"\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Are taking anticoagulant medications (warfarin or heparin)\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"or have a history of bleeding disorders.\"\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"